sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as API
    participant S as Storage Adapter
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    U->>A: Upload attachment
    A->>A: Validate permission/type/size
    A->>S: Store private object
    S-->>A: storage_key/checksum
    A->>D: Save file_assets + association
    D-->>A: File metadata
    A-->>U: Attachment metadata

    U->>A: Download attachment
    A->>D: Check entity + permission
    D-->>A: Authorized storage reference
    A->>S: Read/stream private object
    S-->>A: File stream
    A-->>U: Authorized download
